    "schemaVersion": 1,
    "description": "<section class=\"hol-item-reference\"><p class=\"hol-automation-label\"><strong>Automation:</strong> Reviewed native action · rules reference</p><div class=\"hol-reference-flavor\"><p>You lift the battered shield and turn with every impact. There is always another edge waiting behind its rim.</p></div><h2>Rules</h2><dl class=\"hol-reference-details\"><div><dt>Action</dt><dd>Reaction</dd></div><div><dt>Attribute</dt><dd>None (no roll)</dd></div><div><dt>Target / range / shape</dt><dd>Self before a shield-blockable defense.</dd></div><div><dt>Equipment / acquisition</dt><dd>Use a held ordinary shield (Bulk 1), supplied on learning if needed.</dd></div><div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Skill / Defense</dd></div></dl><div class=\"hol-reference-rules\"><p>Use Shield Block as part of this Reaction, granting 2 Boons to eligible defenses until the start of your next turn.</p></div><p class=\"hol-reference-source\"><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/bruceamoser/heroes-of-legend/blob/25b80c9fe77d7baaec3f3a8a548c9663d0f39a30/design/cards/high-guard.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">design/cards/high-guard.md</a> at <code>25b80c9fe77d7baaec3f3a8a548c9663d0f39a30</code>.</p></section>",
